'''Ro Station''' was a [[city]] located on the [[moon]] [[Pantora]]. During the [[Imperial Era|early days]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], the outpost's business and industry was struggling despite the end of the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|pantora|Pantora}}</ref> At one point, the renegade [[clone commando]]s of the [[Clone Force 99|Bad Batch]] briefly kept their [[starship]], the [[Marauder (Omicron-class)|''Marauder'']], interred at a refueling depot, which was overseen by the [[Sullustan]] manager [[Raspar Six]], located in Ro Station during a [[Chase on Pantora|supply run]]. As [[Hunter]], [[Echo]], and [[Omega]] ventured into the outpost, matters were complicated by the arrival of [[bounty hunter]] [[Fennec Shand]], who sought to [[Hunting|capture]] Omega.<ref name="Cornered" />

